riod": "month", "rank": 9, "date": "2025-07-01"}, {"category": "all", "period": "year", "rank": 169, "date": "2025"}, {"category": "game", "period": "day", "rank": 1, "date": "2025-06-11"}, {"category": "game", "period": "week", "rank": 3, "date": "2025-06-14"}, {"category": "game", "period": "month", "rank": 6, "date": "2025-07-01"}, {"category": "game", "period": "year", "rank": 86, "date": "2025"}], "images": {"main": "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_main.jpg", "thumb": "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp6.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp7.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp8.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp9.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp6_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp7_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp8_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01406000/RJ01405281_img_smp9_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "あらすじ | Story Overview", "body": [{"intro": "勉強に疲れ、ひとときの休息を求めて入院した青年。しかし、この病院は普通の場所ではなかった。静かな入院生活のはずが、やがて現実と悪夢の境界が曖昧になっていく。<br />\n<br />\n目に見えるものすべてを疑いながら、あなたはこの場所に潜む“真実”に少しずつ近づいていく。絶望が支配する5つの夜の果てに、すべてが明らかになる──―。<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nBurned out from studying, a man checks into a hospital in search of rest. But this place is far from ordinary. What begins as a quiet stay soon slips into something surreal—where the line between reality and nightmare starts to blur.<br />\n<br />\nWith every passing night, doubts grow. You must question what’s real and slowly uncover the hidden truth buried within these halls. Only by surviving all five nights of despair will the full picture come into view."}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "ゲームプレイ | Gameplay", "body": [{"intro": "昼のあいだ、あなたは病院内を探索しながら、個性的な入院患者や職員たちと出会い、クエストを進めていくことになる。会話やイベントを通じて、物語の断片や重要な手がかりを集めよう。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nしかし、夜になると病院は一変し、彼らは恐ろしい存在へと変貌する。あなたは隠れたり逃げたりしながら、限られたアイテムや環境を駆使して、生き延びなければならない。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the day, you’ll explore the hospital, meet eccentric patients and staff, and progress through various quests. Through conversations and events, you'll uncover fragments of the story and gather crucial clues.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut when night falls, everything changes. Those familiar faces transform into terrifying creatures. You’ll have to hide, run, and make clever use of limited items and your surroundings if you hope to survive until morning.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/56e7567fbcb0152f53d798de2def0db9.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}, "position": "under"}]}, {"type": "image_list", "title": "朝まで生き延びろ | Survive Until Morning", "body": [{"intro": "悪夢の中で、君は昼間に出会ったはずの人々と、再び顔を合わせることになる。しかしそこにいるのは、もはや君が知る“彼女ら”ではない。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the nightmare, you will once again encounter the people you met during the day. But the ones you face now are no longer the \"ones\" you knew.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/0b2cd984a8779143c1e6c952707f626d.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}}, {"intro": "病院内には、生き延びるための手がかりやアイテムが隠されている。慎重に探索し、夜の恐怖に備えろ。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHidden within the hospital are clues and items needed to survive. Explore carefully, and prepare for the horrors of the night.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/0e17b03ff8b859d2405b1129717c2ed5.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}}, {"intro": "逃げろ、隠れろ。さもなければ──君は、奴らの餌食になる。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRun. Hide. Otherwise… you’ll become their prey.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/f7b5f5d1e619f98b726c24de97f4d6ef.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}}, {"intro": "5日間──そして、5つの終わらない夜。<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFive days… and five endless nights.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/be05b48a1ab6646458bb10d157bead2f.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/0415a60439727de84685ea5abb492cd3.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "ゲームをクリアした後 | Post-Game Content", "body": [{"intro": "・すべてのHシーンを再体験できるようになります。<br />\r\n・特定の昼と夜のエピソードを再度プレイすることが可能になります。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n・All H-scenes can be revisited at any time.<br />\r\n・Specific day and night episodes can also be replayed.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01406000/RJ01405281/7ae4e2b1abdca85996a62ce627fcc37c.jpg", "alt": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]", "title": "Hospital Seduction [Tsurisu]"}, "position": "under"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "特徴 | Features", "body": [{"intro": "・プレイ時間: 約2時間(※内部テスト基準)<br />\r\n・エンディング: 2つ<br />\r\n・登場キャラクター: 12人<br />\r\n・対応言語: 日本語、English、中文、Русский<br />\r\n<br />\r\n・Play Time: Approx. 2 hours (based on internal testing)<br />\r\n・Endings: 2<br />\r\n・Characters: 12 unique characters<br />\r\n・Languages: Japanese, English, Chinese, Russian"}]}], "description": "目に見えるものすべてを疑いながら、あなたはこの場所に潜む“真実”に少しずつ近づいていく。絶望が支配する5つの夜の果てに、すべてが明らかになる──。", "short_introduction": "目に見えるものすべてを疑いながら、あなたはこの場所に潜む“真実”に少しずつ近づいていく。絶望が支配する5つの夜の果てに、すべてが明らかになる──。", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01405281.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794948425}